  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land, Soil and Crop Information Services to support Climate Smart Agriculture (LSC-IS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The general objective of this activity is to develop sustainable land, soil, crop information hubs in national agricultural research organisations that facilitate the exchange of knowledge and information between farmers, knowledge organisations, private sector and policy makers, enhance the effectiveness of national Agricultural Knowledge and Innovation Systems (AKIS 2.0) and contribute to rural transformation and Climate Smart Agriculture in East Africa.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
